        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Data represents current technologies\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes material consumption and energy expenditures related with the construction sealed area (aircraft parking, runways, etc...) at airports. In addition, expenditures for buildings are considered. The latter include expenditures due to refurbishment and demolition.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
